#MOBILE
Vnum       208
Keywords   maintenance robot r2~
Short      an maintenance robot~
Long       maintenance robot wheels around the floor.
~
Desc       This common make of maintenance robot is also known as an R2 unit. It is
a small wheeled robot designed primarily for ship maintenence and
repair. It has an interface apendage to plug into a ships computer as
well as several other tools hidden within its domed frame that it
uses to preform various functions.
~
